==== soft gates (documenting the D1 verdict) ====
  PASS  LS1 matrix perturbation is O(1) on the physical scale (agg ord <= 0.3) — linear INSUFFICIENT for the matrix path
  PASS  LS2 matrix perturbation decays (agg ord >= 0.6) — quadratic gives consistent seam rows
  PASS  LS2 divergence perturbation decays at >= 1st order (rms agg)
  PASS  LS2 matrix perturbation < 3% of |lap phi| at finest
